<messaging:emailTemplate subject="Password Reset for Your Modon Account" recipientType="User" relatedToType="UserAccess__c">
<messaging:htmlEmailBody >
Dear {!relatedTo.First_Name__c} {!relatedTo.Last_Name__c},

<p>It seems you may be experiencing difficulty accessing your account on Modon’s platform. Below are your login credentials for the same.</p>

<p><b>URL:</b> <a href="https://cportal.modon.com/createpassword/{!relatedTo.EmailBase64String__c}">https://cportal.modon.com/createpassword/{!relatedTo.EmailBase64String__c}</a></p>


<p>We appreciate your continued trust in Modon,
and we are here to provide any further assistance you may require.</p>

<p>Regards,</p>

<p>Modon Properties</p>
</messaging:htmlEmailBody>
</messaging:emailTemplate>